# Hutao Columbina Fischl Mona. ~21s Rot. Hutao HexLunarOverVape. Hutao 8[N2CD]. P.Amber Mona hits the field twice. Columbina P.Amber is -?K DPS. Hutao Vapes ~70% of her CAs. C0 Mona is ~21K DPS loss.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
hutao char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
